Modification notice
-------------------

The distributed QIPACK files were converted from their named source
checkpoints for use by qwen-image-cplus on Apple Silicon. The conversion
changes the tensor storage container and stores transformer-block matrices as
FP16 while retaining vectors and global tensors as BF16. It does not retrain
the model.

The base pack was converted from:

  Qwen/Qwen-Image-2.1
  Revision b3179ad355be050328e483a9dfdd9e60cd62adfa

The four-step distilled pack was converted from the full transformer in:

  Viggle/Qwen-Image-2.1-viggle-turbo
  Revision bafc91e4cc934f5fb1406b22496a0bed9b99c548

The distilled model was created and published by Viggle under the Qwen
Research License. The QIPACK conversion was produced by the
qwen-image-cplus project.

